Mark, short update on the TMS upgrade: all 40 test cases passed on 9.2.0.3 af=
ter RouteWise fixed two defects (multi-stop rates and CO2 field). Rollback pl=
an: snapshot on Friday 23 Oct 18:00, decision point Saturday 22:00, restore t=
akes about 3 hours. Planning will be limited from Friday 18:00 until Sunday 1=
4:00, so Venlo and Rotterdam should book urgent loads by Friday noon. Can you=
 give us your OK for the go-live?

Regards,
